          "settings": {
            "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  SORELYA — BLOC 01 : badge « Best-Seller » + étoiles + note\n  Clone du badge BioChroma (placé juste au-dessus du titre produit).\n  Mobile-first. Toutes les valeurs éditables sont ci-dessous.\n  À coller dans un bloc « Custom Liquid » de la section produit, AU-DESSUS du bloc Titre.\n\n  Nom du produit (validé le 2026-09-24, dans Shopify > Produit > Titre, pas ici) :\n  \"Sérum Coreano de Péptidos de Seda Sorelya™\"\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_badge      = \"El sérum coreano del que todas hablan\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_note       = \"4.8\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_note_sur5  = 4.8 -%}\n{%- assign sor_nb_avis    = \"12.700+\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_afficher_avis = true -%}\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Ancre vers la section avis\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign sor_lien_avis  = \"#sor-avis\" -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_pct = sor_note_sur5 | times: 20 -%}\n\n<div class=\"sor-b01\">\n  <a\n    class=\"sor-b01__row\"\n    {% if sor_lien_avis != blank %}\n      href=\"{{ sor_lien_avis }}\"\n    {% endif %}\n    aria-label=\"{{ sor_badge }} — valoración {{ sor_note }} de 5\"\n  >\n\n    <span class=\"sor-b01__badge\">\n      {{ sor_badge }}\n    </span>\n\n    <span class=\"sor-b01__rating\">\n\n      <span class=\"sor-b01__stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <span class=\"sor-b01__stars-bg\">★★★★★</span>\n        <span\n          class=\"sor-b01__stars-fg\"\n          style=\"width:{{ sor_pct }}%\"\n        >\n          ★★★★★\n        </span>\n      </span>\n\n      <strong class=\"sor-b01__note\">\n        {{ sor_note }}\n      </strong>\n\n      {%- if sor_afficher_avis -%}\n        <span class=\"sor-b01__avis\">\n          ({{ sor_nb_avis }} reseñas)\n        </span>\n      {%- endif -%}\n\n    </span>\n\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .sor-b01{\n    --sor-ink:#2B2220;\n    --sor-gris:#6F6461;\n    --sor-rose:#D9A79D;\n    --sor-rose-clair:#F8ECE9;\n    --sor-etoile:#E0A23B;\n    margin:0 0 10px;\n    font-family:inherit;\n  }\n\n  .sor-b01__row{\n    display:flex;\n    flex-wrap:wrap;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:6px 10px;\n    text-decoration:none;\n    color:var(--sor-ink);\n  }\n\n  .sor-b01__badge{\n    display:inline-flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    padding:4px 10px;\n    border-radius:999px;\n    background:var(--sor-rose-clair);\n    color:#9A5E53;\n    font-size:12px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    letter-spacing:.02em;\n    line-height:1.3;\n  }\n\n  .sor-b01__rating{\n    display:inline-flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:6px;\n    font-size:13px;\n    line-height:1;\n    white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .sor-b01__stars{\n    position:relative;\n    display:inline-block;\n    font-size:15px;\n    letter-spacing:1px;\n    line-height:1;\n  }\n\n  .sor-b01__stars-bg{\n    color:#E4DAD7;\n  }\n\n  .sor-b01__stars-fg{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:0;\n    top:0;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    white-space:nowrap;\n    color:var(--sor-etoile);\n  }\n\n  .sor-b01__note{\n    font-weight:700;\n    color:var(--sor-ink);\n  }\n\n  .sor-b01__avis{\n    color:var(--sor-gris);\n    text-decoration:underline;\n    text-underline-offset:2px;\n  }\n\n  @media (min-width:750px){\n    .sor-b01__badge{\n      font-size:13px;\n    }\n\n    .sor-b01__rating{\n      font-size:14px;\n    }\n\n    .sor-b01__stars{\n      font-size:16px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
