        "liquid_Afy9qD": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  SORELYA — BLOC 02 : sous-titre promesse + 4 bénéfices à icônes\n  Clone du bloc BioChroma (sous le titre, au-dessus des bundles).\n  Promesse identique à BioChroma (bible règle 0.4-1), bénéfices adaptés aux avatars Sorelya :\n  1 = promesse n°1 · 2 = résultat visible · 3 = A3 « Botox sans aiguille » · 4 = soin clinique à la maison.\n  Mobile-first : grille 2×2 à toutes les tailles (la colonne produit reste étroite sur desktop).\n  Icônes = 4 PNG Shopify (2026-09-24), servies SANS le suffixe _430x (sinon floues) + srcset 1x/2x/3x.\n  Libellés dans la police des titres du thème (variables Dawn --font-heading-*), comme le titre produit et le bloc 05.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign sor_mecanisme  = \"Péptidos de Seda Dorada\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_nb_actifs  = \"28\" -%}\n\n{%- capture sor_soustitre -%}\nUna piel más firme, más jugosa y más joven <strong>desde la primera aplicación</strong>. Los {{ sor_mecanisme }} y {{ sor_nb_actifs }} activos bioactivos llegan donde nacen las arrugas y reconstruyen desde dentro, tejiendo una <strong>red de sujeción para tu rostro</strong>. <strong>Resultados garantizados o te devolvemos tu dinero.</strong>\n{%- endcapture -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} Libellés des 4 bénéfices, dans l'ordre des icônes (lift, rides, seringue, clinique). {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign sor_b1 = \"Efecto lifting inmediato y progresivo\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_b2 = \"Arrugas suavizadas, piel más jugosa\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_b3 = \"El nuevo bótox, sin agujas\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_b4 = \"Tratamiento de clínica coreana en casa\" -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} Icônes, même ordre que les libellés. URL SANS _430x. {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign sor_i1 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/ChatGPT_Image_24_sept._2026_19_16_08.png?v=1790292074\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_i2 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/ChatGPT_Image_24_sept._2026_19_19_04.png?v=1790292074\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_i3 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/ChatGPT_Image_24_sept._2026_19_20_36.png?v=1790292074\" -%}\n{%- assign sor_i4 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/4106/8645/files/ChatGPT_Image_24_sept._2026_19_21_17.png?v=1790292085\" -%}\n\n<div class=\"sor-b02\">\n  <p class=\"sor-b02__sub\">{{ sor_soustitre }}</p>\n\n  <ul class=\"sor-b02__grid\" role=\"list\">\n    <li class=\"sor-b02__item\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b02__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <img src=\"{{ sor_i1 }}&width=80\" srcset=\"{{ sor_i1 }}&width=40 1x, {{ sor_i1 }}&width=80 2x, {{ sor_i1 }}&width=120 3x\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"sor-b02__txt\">{{ sor_b1 }}</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"sor-b02__item\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b02__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <img src=\"{{ sor_i2 }}&width=80\" srcset=\"{{ sor_i2 }}&width=40 1x, {{ sor_i2 }}&width=80 2x, {{ sor_i2 }}&width=120 3x\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"sor-b02__txt\">{{ sor_b2 }}</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"sor-b02__item\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b02__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <img src=\"{{ sor_i3 }}&width=80\" srcset=\"{{ sor_i3 }}&width=40 1x, {{ sor_i3 }}&width=80 2x, {{ sor_i3 }}&width=120 3x\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"sor-b02__txt\">{{ sor_b3 }}</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"sor-b02__item\">\n      <span class=\"sor-b02__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <img src=\"{{ sor_i4 }}&width=80\" srcset=\"{{ sor_i4 }}&width=40 1x, {{ sor_i4 }}&width=80 2x, {{ sor_i4 }}&width=120 3x\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"sor-b02__txt\">{{ sor_b4 }}</span>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .sor-b02{\n    --sor-ink:#2B2220;\n    --sor-texte:#4A3F3C;\n    --sor-rose:#D9A79D;\n    --sor-rose-fonce:#9A5E53;\n    --sor-rose-clair:#F8ECE9;\n    margin:4px 0 14px;\n  }\n  .sor-b02__sub{\n    margin:0 0 14px;\n    font-size:15px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    color:var(--sor-texte);\n  }\n  .sor-b02__sub strong{ color:var(--sor-ink); font-weight:700; }\n\n  .sor-b02__grid{\n    list-style:none;\n    margin:0;\n    padding:0;\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;\n    gap:8px;\n  }\n  .sor-b02__item{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:8px;\n    min-height:52px;\n    padding:8px 10px 8px 8px;\n    border-radius:12px;\n    background:var(--sor-rose-clair);\n  }\n  .sor-b02__ico{\n    flex:0 0 35px;\n    width:35px;\n    height:35px;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    background:#fff;\n    display:grid;\n    place-items:center;\n  }\n  .sor-b02__ico img{\n    display:block;\n    width:35px;\n    height:35px;\n    object-fit:contain;\n    transform:scale(1.12);\n  }\n  .sor-b02__txt{\n    font-family:var(--font-heading-family, inherit);\n    font-style:var(--font-heading-style, normal);\n    font-weight:var(--font-heading-weight, 700);\n    font-size:13.5px;\n    line-height:1.25;\n    letter-spacing:0;\n    color:var(--sor-ink);\n  }\n\n  @media (min-width:750px){\n    .sor-b02__sub{ font-size:16px; }\n    .sor-b02__txt{ font-size:14.5px; }\n    .sor-b02__ico, .sor-b02__ico img{ width:38px; height:38px; flex-basis:38px; }\n  }\n</style>"
